# A longer Russian story: read it all yourself
subtitle: "Read a nine-sentence Russian story made only of words from lessons 1–9, hear it, test what you understood, and see how far you've come."
teaches: ["reading/reading-stories"]
thumb: "band \"Read it all yourself\" note \"10 lessons, 1 story\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Plurals in Russian: коты, книги, окна","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/11-russian-plural.cast"}

## A longer Russian story: read it all yourself
level: basic

    glossed s1 "Э́то рестора́н. Стол но́мер семь." say_voice b gloss ["this is","restaurant","table","number","seven"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 660 font_size 36 hidden true
    glossed s2 "Тут моя́ ма́ма, мой па́па и мой брат." say_voice b gloss ["here","my","mum","my","dad","and","my","brother"] show_gloss after x 500 y 570 font_size 36 hidden true
    glossed s3 "Па́па пьёт ко́фе, ма́ма пьёт чай." say_voice b gloss ["dad","drinks","coffee","mum","drinks","tea"] show_gloss after x 500 y 480 font_size 36 hidden true
    glossed s4 "Брат говори́т: «Суп, пожа́луйста!»" say_voice b gloss ["brother","says","soup","please"] show_gloss after x 500 y 390 font_size 36 hidden true
    glossed s5 "Том то́же тут. Он немно́го говори́т по-ру́сски." say_voice b gloss ["Tom","too","here","he","a little","speaks","in Russian"] show_gloss after x 500 y 300 font_size 36 hidden true
    glossed s6 "А где кот? Он то́же тут, на окне́!" say_voice b gloss ["and","where","cat","he","too","here","on","window"] show_gloss after x 500 y 210 font_size 36 hidden true
    group story members ["s1","s2","s3","s4","s5","s6"] hidden true
    icon open_rest size 180 set twemoji x 360 y 420 or ["fork and knife","restaurant"] icon_look picture of "fork and knife with plate" hidden true
    icon open_cat size 180 set twemoji x 640 y 420 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat hidden true
    icon score_cat size 190 set twemoji x 420 y 430 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat hidden true
    icon score_win size 190 set twemoji x 600 y 430 or ["framed picture"] icon_look picture of window hidden true
    icon end_tom size 190 set twemoji x 300 y 420 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    icon end_masha size 190 set twemoji x 700 y 420 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    box L1 "1.  кот" say кот width 330 height 70 radius 12 font_size 30 in grid hidden true
    box L2 "2.  он · она́ · оно́" say "он · она́ · оно́" width 330 height 70 radius 12 font_size 30 in grid hidden true
    box L3 "3.  Приве́т!" say Приве́т! width 330 height 70 radius 12 font_size 30 in grid hidden true
    box L4 "4.  пожа́луйста" say пожа́луйста width 330 height 70 radius 12 font_size 30 in grid hidden true
    box L5 "5.  Кот то́же пьёт!" say "Кот то́же пьёт!" width 330 height 70 radius 12 font_size 30 in grid hidden true
    box L6 "6.  оди́н, два, три…" say "оди́н, два, три" width 330 height 70 radius 12 font_size 30 in grid hidden true
    box L7 "7.  Я говорю́" say "Я говорю́" width 330 height 70 radius 12 font_size 30 in grid hidden true
    box L8 "8.  мой · моя́ · моё" say "мой · моя́ · моё" width 330 height 70 radius 12 font_size 30 in grid hidden true
    box L9 "9.  Где кот?" say "Где кот?" width 330 height 70 radius 12 font_size 30 in grid hidden true
    box L10 "10.  Том то́же тут!" say "Том то́же тут!" width 330 height 70 radius 12 font_size 30 in grid hidden true
    grid grid members ["L1","L6","L2","L7","L3","L8","L4","L9","L5","L10"] gap 14 columns 2 fit.h 470 fit.w 780 fit.x 110 fit.y 165 hidden true

A: Can you read a whole Russian story on your own? This one has nine sentences.
    draw open_rest open_cat parallel true

    erase open_rest open_cat

A: Every word in it comes from lessons one to nine: read it first, and tap any word you're unsure of.
    draw s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6

B: Э́то рестора́н. Стол но́мер семь.
    highlight s1_words color #c9871a

B: Тут моя́ ма́ма, мой па́па и мой брат.
    highlight s2_words color #c9871a

B: Па́па пьёт ко́фе, ма́ма пьёт чай.
    highlight s3_words color #c9871a

B: Брат говори́т: «Суп, пожа́луйста!»
    highlight s4_words color #c9871a

B: Том то́же тут. Он немно́го говори́т по-ру́сски.
    highlight s5_words color #c9871a

B: А где кот? Он то́же тут, на окне́!
    highlight s6_words color #c9871a

A: It opens with э́то, this is, from lesson eight, and a number from lesson six: стол но́мер семь, table seven, with the soft sign at the end.
    blocking false

    highlight s1_w_1 color #c9871a duration 2.6

    highlight s1_w_3 s1_w_4 s1_w_5 color #c9871a duration 3.2

    highlight s1_w_5 part ь$ effect pulse color #8f887c duration 2.6

B: Тут, here, from lesson nine: here are my mum, my dad and my brother.
    highlight s2_words color #c9871a

A: Мой or моя́? The noun decides: моя́ ма́ма, with the red я of a she, then мой брат, ending in a consonant, and мой па́па, still a he.
    blocking false

    highlight s2_w_2 part я$ effect pulse color #b5482e duration 1.3

    highlight s2_w_3 part а$ effect pulse color #b5482e duration 1.3

    highlight s2_w_7 s2_w_8 color #c9871a duration 2.6

    highlight s2_w_4 s2_w_5 color #c9871a duration 2.6

A: The drinks are lesson five's: dad drinks coffee, mum drinks tea.
    highlight s3_w_2 s3_w_5 color #c9871a

B: And my brother? Суп, пожа́луйста!
    highlight s4_words color #c9871a

A: Говори́т is lesson seven's verb: here it means says, and later on, speaks.
    highlight s4_w_2 s5_w_6 color #c9871a

A: Then a surprise: Том то́же тут. That's me: Tom is here too!
    highlight s5_w_1 s5_w_2 s5_w_3 color #c9871a

B: Он немно́го говори́т по-ру́сски: he speaks a little Russian.
    highlight s5_w_4 s5_w_5 s5_w_6 s5_w_7 color #c9871a

A: Only a little? Well, the ending is right: говори́т, with the -ит of он and она.
    blocking false

    pause 1.6

    highlight s5_w_6 part ит$ effect pulse color #8a5fa8 duration 2.8

A: Last, где, where, from lesson nine: so where's the cat?
    highlight s6_w_1 s6_w_2 s6_w_3 color #c9871a

B: Он то́же тут, на окне́: on the window, with the е after на from lesson five.
    blocking false

    highlight s6_w_4 s6_w_5 s6_w_6 s6_w_7 s6_w_8 color #c9871a duration 2.4

    highlight s6_w_8 part е$ color #d0865f duration 3

    hide story s1_g_1 s1_g_2 s1_g_3 s1_g_4 s1_g_5 s2_g_1 s2_g_2 s2_g_3 s2_g_4 s2_g_5 s2_g_6 s2_g_7 s2_g_8 s3_g_1 s3_g_2 s3_g_3 s3_g_4 s3_g_5 s3_g_6 s4_g_1 s4_g_2 s4_g_3 s4_g_4 s5_g_1 s5_g_2 s5_g_3 s5_g_4 s5_g_5 s5_g_6 s5_g_7 s6_g_1 s6_g_2 s6_g_3 s6_g_4 s6_g_5 s6_g_6 s6_g_7 s6_g_8

    quiz "What number is the table? Pick one." reveal.text "стол но́мер семь" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1 pool false
        intro: Now five questions on the story, from memory.
        right: Семь, seven: стол но́мер семь.
        wrong: Look back at the first line: стол но́мер… which one?
        * пять
        + семь
        * де́сять

    erase reveal_1_stamp

    quiz "Who drinks tea? Pick one." reveal.text "ма́ма пьёт чай" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1 pool false
        right: Mum: ма́ма пьёт чай, and dad has the coffee.
        wrong: Dad has the coffee; who has the other drink?
        * Па́па
        * Брат
        + Ма́ма

    erase reveal_2_stamp

    ask "What does the brother ask for? Type it in Russian." answer ["суп","суп пожалуйста","суп, пожалуйста","суп, пожалуйста!"] translit true reveal.text "Суп, пожа́луйста!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1 pool false
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЧШЫЬЭЯ
        right: Суп: брат говори́т, суп, пожа́луйста!
        wrong: Three letters, and you ordered it in the café lesson.

    erase reveal_3_stamp

    quiz "Who speaks a little Russian? Pick one." reveal.text "Том немно́го говори́т" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1 pool false
        right: Tom: Том немно́го говори́т по-ру́сски. A little!
        wrong: Who was the surprise guest at the table?
        + Том
        * Брат
        * Кот

    erase reveal_4_stamp

    quiz "Где кот? Where is the cat? Pick one." reveal.text "на окне́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1 pool false
        right: On the window: он то́же тут, на окне́.
        wrong: The last sentence: он то́же тут, на… what?
        * на столе́
        * в до́ме
        + на окне́

    erase reveal_5_stamp

    draw score_cat score_win parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase score_cat score_win

    draw grid

A: Now look back at ten lessons. You can read the letters, and a word's last letter tells you he, she or it.
    highlight L1 L2

B: You can say hello, order in a café, and count to ten.
    highlight L3 L4 L6

A: You can say who speaks what, whose mum it is, and where the cat is.
    highlight L7 L8 L9

A: And you've just read nine sentences on your own: the old words did all the work, and not one word was new.
    highlight L5 L10

    erase grid

B: Спаси́бо и до свида́ния!
    draw end_tom end_masha parallel true

